OL,3,GNEWSACause of fatal shed explosion not 
OL,4,Afound, inquest told                    
OL,6,FAn investigation into a fire which led 
OL,7,Fto an explosion that killed a          
OL,8,F91-year-old man in his shed did not    
OL,9,Ffind a cause of the blaze, an inquest  
OL,10,Fhas heard.                             
OL,12,FDerek Poole died in a shed used as a   
OL,13,Fworkshop outside his home in Church    
OL,14,FLane in Selston, Nottinghamshire, on 9 
OL,15,FMay.                                   
OL,17,FOn Thursday, Nottingham Coroner's Court
OL,18,Fheard a cause of death was given as    
OL,19,Fbeing "consistent with the inhalation  
OL,20,Fof the products of combustion", with   
OL,21,Fischaemic heart disease also a factor. 
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
