OL,3,GNEWSACause of fatal shed explosion not 
OL,4,Afound, inquest told                    
OL,6,FIn a narrative conclusion, senior      
OL,7,Fcoroner Mairin Casey said it was       
OL,8,F"impossible" to determine if the fire  
OL,9,Fwas started "deliberately or           
OL,10,Faccidentally".                         
